\item[S2] Dorin Ervin Dutkay and Palle E. T. Jorgensen, The momentum operator on a union of intervals and the Fuglede conjecture (2023), arXiv:2301.11377, Abstract and Section 1, pp. 1–2; Section 6. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2301.11377}.
